    "summary": "Bearer must be an **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** model. Its unit can still shoot, declare a charge, or both in a turn when it has [Fallen Back](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back). Once per battle, during the opposing player's [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), if an enemy unit finishes an Advance, Fall Back or Normal move no more than 8 inches from the bearer, the bearer's unit may move up to 6 inches with a Normal move, provided it is outside **Engagement Range** of every enemy unit.",
